# Shalih Shoes — Project Context (Modules 1–7)
# Thrift sneaker/chappal e-commerce, Pakistan. Treat all facts below as ground truth. Do not invent business details.

## Business
- Pre-loved/thrift sneakers (Nike AF1, Jordan) + chappals (Adidas/Nike slides). Footwear only.
- Audience: youth 16–30, major PK cities. Mobile-first (3G/4G).
- Single inventory owner (NOT peer marketplace). Trust + condition transparency = #1 UX priority.
- Payments P1: COD + Manual Bank Transfer only. P2: JazzCash/Easypaisa. No live gateway in MVP.
- Must feel premium (GOAT/StockX/Nike), NOT Instagram reseller page.

## Stack (LOCKED — do not change)
- Frontend: Next.js App Router, React, TypeScript, Tailwind, shadcn/ui → Vercel
- Backend: FastAPI (async), PostgreSQL, Redis → Koyeb, Neon
- Admin: Custom FastAPI admin (not Django). Multi-page site (NOT SPA). SEO-critical.

## Design System (Module 3 — no hardcoded colors)
- Dark-first: bg `#0A0A0B`, surface `#141416`, elevated `#1C1C1F`, border `#2A2A2E`
- Text: primary `#F5F5F4`, secondary `#A1A1A6`, tertiary `#6E6E73`
- Accent (ONE color): `#D4FF3F` lime — CTAs, prices, active filters, hover only. NOT bg floods/body text.
- Alt accent: `#FF4D2E`. Semantic: success `#34D399`, warning `#FBBF24`, danger `#F87171`
- Condition grades: mint 9-10 `#34D399`, good 7-8 `#D4FF3F`, fair 5-6 `#FBBF24`
- Fonts: Display = Archivo Black (or Clash Display), Body = Inter
- Spacing: 8px scale. Radius: sm 4px, md 8px, lg 16px. Container max 1440px.
- Cards: 1px border, no heavy shadows. Motion: 150–200ms ease-out. NO Material UI.

## MVP Scope
IN: Home, Shop/Catalog, PDP, Cart, Checkout, Order confirmation/tracking, Auth, Account, Search, About, Contact, Admin panel.
OUT: Live gateways, wishlist, reviews/ratings, seller marketplace features.

## Routes (22)
Storefront: /, /shop, /shop/[category], /product/[slug], /cart, /checkout, /order-confirmation/[id], /account, /account/orders/[id], /auth/login, /auth/signup, /search, /about, /contact, 404
Admin: /admin/login, /dashboard, /products, /products/[id]/edit, /orders, /orders/[id]

## Key UX Rules
- Condition badge ON product image (always visible, not hover-only). Real photos, not stock.
- Product card: hover crossfade to 2nd angle (desktop). Thrift = 1 unit/size, no qty in cart.
- PDP: sticky mobile Add-to-Cart bar. Checkout: calmer, payment as tappable cards (COD/Bank).
- Filters in URL params (?brand=nike&size=42). Min tap target 44px. Build mobile-first.

## Folder Structure
/app/(storefront)/ — customer pages with Navbar+Footer layout
/app/admin/ — separate auth guard + utility UI
/components/{layout,product,filters,cart,account,shared,ui}
/lib/{api,store,utils,types} — Zustand: cartStore, authStore; hooks: useCart, useAuth, useFilters
/styles/globals.css — CSS variables from Module 3

## State
- Cart: Zustand + localStorage (guest); sync via POST /api/cart/sync on login
- Auth: JWT in httpOnly cookie (NOT localStorage); middleware protects /account/*
- Filters: URL search params = source of truth
- Data: Server Components for product lists/PDP; client fetch for cart, account, checkout

## Components (28 — build order: tokens → shared → product → layout → filters → cart → account)
Layout: Navbar, Footer, MobileFilterDrawer
Product: ProductCard, ConditionBadge, PriceTag, SizeSelector, ProductGallery, ProductGrid
Filters: FilterSidebar, ActiveFilterChips, SortDropdown, SearchBar
Cart: CartLineItem, CartSummary, PaymentMethodCard, CheckoutForm
Account: OrderStatusStepper, OrderCard, AddressCard
Shared: Button, Badge, Skeleton, Toast, Modal, TrustBadgeRow, EmptyState, Breadcrumbs

## API Endpoints (FastAPI)
Auth: POST signup/login/logout, GET /me
Products: GET /products (brand,size,price_min,max,condition_min,category,sort,page), GET /{slug}, GET /search?q=
Cart: GET /cart, POST /sync, POST/DELETE /items/{id}
Orders: POST /orders, GET /orders, GET /orders/{id}
Admin: CRUD /admin/products, PUT /admin/orders/{id}, GET /admin/dashboard/summary

## Flows
- Auth: login → httpOnly JWT → middleware guard → cart sync
- Checkout: POST /orders → status pending → stock soft-lock (Redis 30-60min) → redirect /order-confirmation/[id]
- Order status: pending → confirmed → shipped → delivered (cancel before shipped). Admin updates manually.
- Bank transfer: show bank details + WhatsApp proof note. WhatsApp notify ops on new order.
- OOS at checkout: inline message + auto-remove from cart. 401 → login with return URL.

## Redis
- Catalog cache (60-120s TTL), stock reservation locks, optional JWT blacklist on logout

## Naming
- Components: PascalCase (ProductCard.tsx). Hooks: useCart.ts. API: verb-first getProducts(). Types: Product, Order, User

## Anti-Patterns (ZERO TOLERANCE)
- Generic Bootstrap/Material/default shadcn light theme
- Plain white cards, hardcoded colors, hover-only critical info
- Live payment gateways, wishlist, reviews, peer seller features in MVP
- JWT in localStorage, inventing screens/endpoints outside spec

## Build Order
1. globals.css + Tailwind tokens  2. shadcn/ui  3. Shared components  4. Product  5. Layout
6. Pages (Home→Shop→PDP→Cart→Checkout)  7. FastAPI + DB + Redis  8. Admin
